{"id":1903,"level":75,"name":"Майстерня зв’язок","group":"Тактика: підсумок","format":27,"description":"<p>A pin is an attack on a piece that cannot go away. If the piece does move away, a stronger piece behind it would drop. But we don't need to tell you that anymore!</p>  <p>During this lesson, it is up to you to deal so cleverly with the theme of&nbsp;pins.&nbsp;Make use of an existing pin to win material, so it will be a real pin party!</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Make use of a pin and win material.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":84,"examples":[{"fen":"r3kb1r/pp2qppp/3p1n2/1NpPn3/5B2/5P1P/PPPQBP2/R3K2R b KQkq - 0 14","pgn":"14... Nxf3+ {[%csl Rd2,Re1,Re2,Ge7,Gf3][%cal Ge7e1,Gf3e1,Gf3d2]} 15. Kd1 Nxd2 * ","text":"<p>Білий слон зв’язаний і тому не може виконувати захисні завдання. Чорні виграють партію за допомогою надсильної шахової вилки.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":75604,"fen":"r3r1k1/ppqnn1pp/2pb1p2/3p4/3P2b1/2P1BN2/PPBN1PPP/R2QR1K1 b - - 0 14","pgn":"{Q=1} 14... Bxh2+ {[%csl Gc7,Rd1,Rf3,Rg1,Gg4,Gh2][%cal Gg4d1,Gh2g1]} 15. Nxh2 Bxd1 * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані фігури не можуть добре захиститися."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75621,"fen":"4rk2/p1p2p1q/2p2P2/1p1bP3/5Q2/7N/PP4PP/6RK b - - 0 28","pgn":"{[#]} {Q=1} 28... Qxh3 {[%csl Gd5,Rg2,Rh1,Gh3][%cal Gd5h1]} * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75625,"fen":"r1b2r1k/pp1p3p/6p1/1P5Q/3P1qN1/P2B4/5PPP/R5K1 w - - 0 22","pgn":"{Q=1} 22. Bxg6 {[%csl Gg6,Gh5,Rh7,Rh8][%cal Gh5h8]} * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75612,"fen":"r4rk1/ppp1qppp/3p1n2/4p2b/2Bn4/1P1P1N1P/PBP2PP1/R2QR1K1 w - - 0 13","pgn":"{Q=1} 13. Bxd4 {[%csl Gd4,Ge1,Re5,Re7][%cal Ge1e7]} exd4 14. Rxe7 * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":75609,"fen":"r3k2r/1p1b1ppp/pq2p3/3p4/8/P